{"name": "CHASM SHIFT", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">DISCLAIMER: This game was designed to be played with a controller. Mouse and keyboard controls have been included for accessibility purposes, and will limit your experience.\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Awaken in the center of a vast and mysterious underworld. Explore complex dungeons, overcome an onslaught of formidable platforming challenges, and discover powerful abilities in the hauntingly beautiful world of Chasm Shift. The chasm beckons. Refute infernal authority. Dispel duplicitous riddles. The accused crown idles. Enshroud thy self. Become annihilation. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"360\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4302110/extras/f7029c6389ad3e5779cff7a886dd762e.poster.avif?t=1782868867\" width=\"640\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4302110/extras/f7029c6389ad3e5779cff7a886dd762e.webm?t=1782868867\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4302110/extras/f7029c6389ad3e5779cff7a886dd762e.mp4?t=1782868867\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore an intricate system of vast puzzle box dungeons</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Complete challenges to unearth abilities that allow for greater traversal</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Plunge into an immersive pixelated atmosphere unlike anything else\u00a0\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"360\" loop=\"\" mute